Source: laghu
Section: httpd
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Codevedas Inc. <opensource@codevedas.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), apache2-dev, cmake,
 dh-sequence-apache2, dh-sequence-nginx, pkgconf, libvips-dev (>= 8.15),
 cargo, rustc (>= 1.86)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://laghu.codevedas.com

Package: ngx-laghu
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, nginx, ${laghu:nginx-abi},
 laghu-libvips (= ${binary:Version})
Provides: libnginx-mod-http-laghu
Replaces: libnginx-mod-http-laghu (<< ${binary:Version})
Conflicts: libnginx-mod-http-laghu (<< ${binary:Version})
Description: native Laghu HTTP optimization module for NGINX
 Installs a precompiled NGINX dynamic module built against the distribution's
 NGINX ABI and enables its load-module configuration. Transformation remains
 disabled until the operator enables Laghu in the HTTP configuration.

Package: laghu-libvips
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, adduser
Replaces: laghu-optimizer (<< ${binary:Version})
Breaks: laghu-optimizer (<< ${binary:Version})
Description: shared asynchronous libvips service for Laghu
 Converts Laghu image and JavaScript jobs and fetches explicitly configured
 external font stylesheets outside request-serving processes. Also packages the
 optional per-origin HTTPS HTML stale-while-revalidate worker.
 The official Ubuntu 24.04 build requires the distribution libvips runtime and
 its JPEG, PNG, GIF, and WebP codec dependencies.

Package: mod-laghu
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, apache2, ${laghu:apache-api},
 laghu-libvips (= ${binary:Version})
Description: native Laghu output-filter module for Apache HTTP Server
 Installs and loads mod_laghu for the distribution Apache 2.4 ABI. Laghu is
 loaded with optimization disabled until the operator explicitly enables it.
